# data set information



# Dataset Overview
# Total Observations: 500,000 patents randomly sampled from the 2000-2020 cohort.
# Time Range: 2000 to 2020 (Grant Years).
# Source: USPTO patent database merged with historical venture capital financing records.

# Variables Overview:
# - patent_id: Unique string identifier for each granted patent.
# - vc_backed: Binary indicator (1 if the assignee received venture capital backing, 0 otherwise).
# - grant_year: Four-digit integer representing the calendar year the patent was officially granted.
# - normalized_forward_citations: Focal patent's raw forward citations divided by the mean citation count 
#   of its specific CPC subclass and grant-year cohort, controlling for technology and age life-cycle biases.
# - npl_ratio: Non-Patent Literature citations divided by the sum of backward patent citations and NPL citations. 
#   This serves as a standard proxy for science intensity (proximity to foundational academic research).
# - total_claims: Total count of legal claims associated with the patent, capturing legal breadth and scope.
# - log_claims: Natural transformation, LN(total_claims + 1), used to correct for the heavy right-tail skewness.

